        "Content": "<ul><li> Charming double-fronted, end-of-terrace period home, dating from c.1860 </li><li> Extensively upgraded and extended in 2005 approx. 120 sq.m. </li><li> Flexible 3/4-bedroom, three-bathroom family accommodation </li><li> Two reception rooms, both with wood-burning stoves </li><li> Impressive open-plan kitchen/dining room with separate utility </li><li> Primary bedroom with en suite and bespoke fitted wardrobes </li><li> Rewired, replumbed and double-glazed throughout with zoned gas heating </li><li> Off-street parking for 2 3 cars and private rear courtyard </li><li> Short stroll to Inchicore Village and LUAS within walking distance </li><li> Excellent city-centre connectivity; New Children`s Hospital less than 10 mins commute</li></ul>"
